  "description": "As a young college student, Jiwon just wants to play video games, study, and...secretly date an older woman who already has a boyfriend?! Nobody knows about the affair, until an attractive upperclassmen named Yuhyeon catches them. He asks Jiwon on a date to keep it secret but, one night becomes much more… *(Source: Tapas)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1746021351), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63215464), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000060628), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10513015), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/youth), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/youth_), [Blice](https://www.blice.co.kr/mw/detail.kt?novelId=72325)\n\n**Official Translation:**  \n[English](https://tapas.io/series/You-th/info), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/146430), [French](https://www.ono.live/webtoon/youth)",
